{{!
    @template vrroomruntime_builtin/liveroom

    The live room panel of the built-in viewer: the notice about what joining shares (IP address
    included), the group room choice, join and leave, the voice controls and the people in the room.
    With roomlist, the single Join button is replaced by the list of rooms
    (vrroomruntime_builtin/liveroomlist, rendered into vrroom-live-roomsbody by live/panel).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region: vrroom-live-notice, vrroom-live-group, vrroom-live-status, vrroom-live-voice, vrroom-live-ptt,
      vrroom-live-insecure, vrroom-live-people, vrroom-live-participants, vrroom-live-count, vrroom-live-current,
      vrroom-live-rooms, vrroom-live-roomsheading, vrroom-live-roomsbody
    * data-action: vrroom-live-join, vrroom-live-leave, vrroom-live-mic, vrroom-live-mute, vrroom-live-talk

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cmid - course module id
    * canjoin - the user can join a room
    * nogroup - the user is in no group of the activity, so there is no room for them
    * secure - the page may use the microphone (a secure context)
    * hasgroups - the activity has group rooms to choose from
    * groups - [{id, name, selected}] the group rooms the user may join
    * maxpeers - most people in one room
    * count - people in the room shown in the heading (0 before joining)
    * notice - plain-text notice to show instead of the default (optional)
    * roomlist - show the list of rooms instead of the single Join button (several rooms per activity)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cmid": 12,
        "canjoin": true,
        "nogroup": false,
        "secure": true,
        "hasgroups": true,
        "groups": [{"id": 7, "name": "Group A", "selected": true}, {"id": 8, "name": "Group B", "selected": false}],
        "maxpeers": 6,
        "count": 0,
        "notice": "",
        "roomlist": true
    }
}}
<h3 class="h5" id="vrroom-liveroom-heading-{{cmid}}">{{#str}}liveroom, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</h3>
<p class="small" data-region="vrroom-live-notice">{{#notice}}{{notice}}{{/notice}}{{^notice}}{{#str}}livenotice, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}{{/notice}}</p>
{{#nogroup}}
<p class="alert alert-info">{{#str}}livenogroup, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</p>
{{/nogroup}}
{{#canjoin}}
<div class="vrroom-live-controls d-flex flex-wrap align-items-end gap-2 mb-2">
    {{#hasgroups}}
    <div class="vrroom-live-groupchoice">
        <label class="form-label mb-1" for="vrroom-live-group-{{cmid}}">{{#str}}livegroupselect, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</label>
        <select id="vrroom-live-group-{{cmid}}" class="form-select" data-region="vrroom-live-group">
            {{#groups}}
            <option value="{{id}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{name}}</option>
            {{/groups}}
        </select>
    </div>
    {{/hasgroups}}
    {{^roomlist}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="vrroom-live-join">{{#str}}livejoin, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
    {{/roomlist}}
    {{#roomlist}}
    <p class="vrroom-live-current fw-bold mb-0 align-self-center d-none" data-region="vrroom-live-current"></p>
    {{/roomlist}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary d-none" data-action="vrroom-live-leave">{{#str}}liveleave, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
</div>
{{#roomlist}}
<div class="vrroom-live-rooms mb-2" data-region="vrroom-live-rooms">
    <h4 class="h6" id="vrroom-live-roomsheading-{{cmid}}" tabindex="-1" data-region="vrroom-live-roomsheading">{{#str}}liverooms, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</h4>
    <div data-region="vrroom-live-roomsbody"></div>
</div>
{{/roomlist}}
{{/canjoin}}
<p class="vrroom-live-status mb-2" data-region="vrroom-live-status" role="status"></p>
<div class="vrroom-live-voice d-none mb-2" data-region="vrroom-live-voice">
    {{#secure}}
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" data-action="vrroom-live-mic">{{#str}}livemicon, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" data-action="vrroom-live-mute" aria-pressed="false" disabled>{{#str}}livemute, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
        <div class="form-check mb-0">
            <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="vrroom-live-ptt-{{cmid}}" data-region="vrroom-live-ptt">
            <label class="form-check-label" for="vrroom-live-ptt-{{cmid}}">{{#str}}livepushtotalk, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</label>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm d-none" data-action="vrroom-live-talk" aria-pressed="false">{{#str}}liveholdtotalk, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
    </div>
    {{/secure}}
    {{^secure}}
    <p class="small text-muted mb-0" data-region="vrroom-live-insecure">{{#str}}livemicinsecure, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</p>
    {{/secure}}
</div>
<div class="vrroom-live-people d-none" data-region="vrroom-live-people">
    <h4 class="h6" data-region="vrroom-live-count">{{#str}}liveparticipants, vrroomruntime_builtin, {{count}}{{/str}}</h4>
    <div class="vrroom-live-participants mb-0" data-region="vrroom-live-participants"></div>
</div>
